0@if103: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc noqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether 7e:1f:3e:65:f8:70 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 0\n    inet 172.20.20.18/24 brd 172.20.20.255 scope global eth0\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 3fff:172:20:20::12/64 scope global nodad \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::7c1f:3eff:fe65:f870/64 scope link \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n104: eth1@if105: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 9500 qdisc noqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether aa:c1:ab:f6:1d:f2 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 1\n    inet 10.0.1.64/24 scope global eth1\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::a8c1:abff:fef6:1df2/64 scope link \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_b8589ee4ffbd4beeb793ee5e'}, {'content': 'Good! I can see that the `ip` command is available. Now let me check the routing table:', 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_99d7124141794e58afac6ce6', 'function': {'name': 'node_config_tool', 'arguments': '{"container_name": "clab-simple-pentest-lab-20260108-023542-cce66afb-redis-target", "command": "ip route show"}'}}]}, {'content': 'Output:\ndefault via 10.0.1.1 dev eth1 \n10.0.1.0/24 dev eth1 proto kernel scope link src 10.0.1.64 \n172.20.20.0/24 dev eth0 proto kernel scope link src 172.20.20.18 \n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_99d7124141794e58afac6ce6'}, {'content': 'Excellent! Let me also verify that the `ping` command is available:', 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_15ff7498fdf04a768ac8ab82', 'function': {'name': 'node_config_tool', 'arguments': '{"container_name": "clab-simple-pentest-lab-20260108-023542-cce66afb-redis-target", "command": "which ping"}'}}]}, {'content': 'Output:\n/usr/bin/ping\n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_15ff7498fdf04a768ac8ab82'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V